---
---
<section class="catch-section reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="catch-inner">
      <div class="catch-icon">
        <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M32 8C24 8 16 14 16 24c0 6 2 10 5 14l4 10c1 3 3 8 7 8s6-5 7-8l4-10c3-4 5-8 5-14 0-10-8-16-16-16z" fill="#018966" opacity="0.15"/>
          <path d="M32 8C24 8 16 14 16 24c0 6 2 10 5 14l4 10c1 3 3 8 7 8s6-5 7-8l4-10c3-4 5-8 5-14 0-10-8-16-16-16z" stroke="#018966" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/>
          <circle cx="26" cy="22" r="2.5" fill="#018966"/>
          <circle cx="38" cy="22" r="2.5" fill="#018966"/>
          <path d="M26 30c1.5 3 10.5 3 12 0" stroke="#018966" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2 class="catch-title">
        <span class="catch-en">CONCEPT</span>
        0才から100才まで<br>みんなが通える歯医者さん
      </h2>
      <p class="catch-text">
        和地たなか歯科は、お子様から高齢の方まで、すべての方が安心して通える歯科医院です。<br>
        バリアフリー設計・女性歯科医師在籍・保育士常駐など、通いやすい環境を整えています。<br>
        お口の健康を通じて、地域の皆さまの笑顔をサポートします。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="catch-photos">
    <div class="catch-photo"><img src="/images/site/catch-1.jpg" alt="院内の様子" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="catch-photo"><img src="/images/site/catch-2.jpg" alt="スタッフの様子" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="catch-photo"><img src="/images/site/catch-3.jpg" alt="診療の様子" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="catch-photo"><img src="/images/site/catch-4.jpg" alt="院内の様子" loading="lazy" /></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.catch-section {
  padding: 80px 0 0;
  background: #fff;
}
.catch-inner {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding-bottom: 60px;
}
.catch-icon {
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.catch-en {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.catch-title {
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.catch-text {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 2;
  color: #555;
}
.catch-photos {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  height: 260px;
}
.catch-photo {
  overflow: hidden;
}
.catch-photo img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}
.catch-photo:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .catch-photos {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    height: 320px;
  }
}
</style>
